SEBI/HO/MIRSD/MIRSD-PoD-1/P/CIR/2023/24 | Enhanced obligations and responsibilities on Qualified Stock Brokers (QSBs) | 9.3. Stock Exchanges shall devise a comprehensive framework 
9. Enhanced Monitoring of QSBs:
9.3. Stock Exchanges shall devise a comprehensive framework to carry out
enhanced monitoring of such QSBs. An illustrative list of areas is as follows:
i. Funds and securities of clients which are handled by the QSB;
ii. Significant changes in net-worth of the QSB;
iii. Significant changes in profits/losses, as compared to previous financial
year;
iv. Adverse findings in audit reports;
v. Adherence to prescribed timelines in case of various periodic
submissions to be made by QSB;
vi. Timely submission of any information sought by SEBI/MIIs;
vii. Adherence to enhanced obligations and responsibilities stated in this
circular; and
viii. Quality of services being provided to investors.

